      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Apply the 2-3-1 rule for normal personal pronouns order (2nd person, 3rd person, 1st person) and 1-2-3 rule when acknowledging a fault or mistake.",
        "Distinguish carefully between possessive pronouns (mine, ours, yours) and possessive adjectives (my, our, your).",
        "Ensure relative pronouns agree properly with their antecedent in subject-verb agreement questions."
